q33 call arena_zero
q34 set q33 0 1
p call ae_ir_append o 97 1 q34
q35 call ae_pairpage p5 p6
q call ae_ir_append p 100 2 q35
q36 set original 1 q8
q37 at p4 1
q38 set q36 2 q37
q39 set q38 3 1
q40 set q39 4 nn
q41 set q40 5 1
q42 at p3 1
q43 div q42 5
q44 add na q43
header set q41 6 q44
r call ae_ir_append q 41 14 header
