fn ae_pump (u32x128,u32x128,io) u32 -> (u32x128,u32x128,io)
m at p0 0
q0 get m 0
q1 eq q0 0
q2 get m 12
request select q1 q2 0
q3 eq request 1
q4 select q3 1 0
a fold ae_validation_pump q4 p0 p1
q5 eq request 2
q6 select q5 1 0
b fold ae_execution_pump q6 a p1
